  "description": "Per-discard isRiichi/isClaimed behavior evidence exported from real V4 domain play. Cases are driven through ApplicationCoordinator legal actions; every value is read from the published GameEvent stream, the public PlayerView projection or PlayerHand.discardHistory. No expected value is hand-written.",
